---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Sources" description="Standards and shop-chart sources behind Drill Chart." path="/sources/">
  <div class="prose">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Sources</p>
    <h1>Sources</h1>
    <ul>
      <li>ASME B94.11M — twist drill diameters for numbered, letter, and fractional jobber drills (summarized; the standard is not reproduced).</li>
      <li>Unified thread tap-drill practice (major diameter − pitch ≈ 75% thread) as published on common shop wall charts.</li>
      <li>ISO metric coarse/fine pitches; hole sizes rounded to bits you can actually buy.</li>
      <li>ISO 273-style clearance practice for close vs free fit (mid-range holes, not every tolerance class).</li>
    </ul>
    <p>If a tap maker specifies a different hole for a forming tap or a specific coating, use that number.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
